@startuml
title 从生产失败生成可回放评测

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "生产 Run\ntrace + artifacts + user impact" as run #E0F2FE
rectangle "失败归因\ncontext / model / tool / policy / runtime" as classify
rectangle "最小可复现场景\n固定输入、环境、mocks、断言" as case #FEF3C7
rectangle "安全脱敏与审核\nowner / risk / retention" as review
rectangle "回归集\n能力桶 + 守门桶 + 版本" as suite
rectangle "候选修复\n一次只改变可归因变量" as fix
rectangle "离线回放 + 灰度\n修复通过且无新增高风险失败" as release #DCFCE7

run --> classify
classify --> case
case --> review
review --> suite
suite --> fix
fix --> release
release --> suite : 新失败继续沉淀

note right of case
  保存的是失败不变量，
  不是把整段生产会话原样复制
end note
@enduml
